# The Midnight Garden: the sea at night, filmed as a wildlife documentary (no toon look, no cartoon characters) - a diver with a torch on a moonlit reef as the corals spawn and the
# plankton lights up round everything that moves, then a remote robot sub on into the dark: siphonophores, comb jellies, lanternfish, an anglerfish, a giant squid, black smokers and
# pillow lava, a brine pool, and a whale fall. Heights on the sea's lines are above the seabed (15 m down: no terrain); the camera's keys are the world's. x z are pbrt's.
film    the-midnight-garden
name    The Midnight Garden
about   The sea at night: a diver on a moonlit reef as the corals spawn, then a robot sub into the dark past siphonophores, lanternfish, an anglerfish and a giant squid to the vents.
scene   film_assets/wild/set.pbrt
length  60
tags    water, nature, night, emissive

music      clear
water      sea  level 0  waves 0.3
sky        23:00 23:30  south 0 physical
moonlight  elevation 55  toward 200  bright 1.2
underwater clarity 2  colour blue  lamp 0.5 blue
exposure   auto 0.2
current    0.05 toward 80
seasparkle amount 1.0

# the reef by moonlight: glowing under the lamps, and spawning
reef       50 in -10 -18 10 -6 fluoresce
nightdive  glow 2  spawn 7 22
seabed     anemones 4 in -6 -10 4 -7
critters   shrimp 8 in -3 -9 3 -6
shells     60 in -6 -8 6 -2
diver      kai from -6 9 2 to -2 3 -6 via -5 6 -2 at 0.5  speed 0.5  lamp  suit black
octopus    3 0 -9  toward 200  jet 12

# a remote robot sub, out into the dark
sub        robot rov at 6 6 -6 to 30 5 -14 to 60 4 -20 to 90 3 -24 to 112 3 -28  speed 2.6  from 15  toward 120
deepsea    siphonophores 2  in 14 6 -20 28 8 -14
deepsea    combjellies 16  in 14 3 -15 26 7 -8
deepsea    lanternfish 120  in 30 2 -22 44 7 -12
deepsea    sparks
deepsea    anglerfish 2  in 50 2 -19 52 3 -17
giantsquid 74 5 -22  length 11  toward 250  from 36  glow 37.5
# the vents: black smokers, pillow lava, a brine pool, and a whale fall
vents      4 in 112 -40 126 -32
pillowlava 121 -22  radius 5
brinepool  106 -25  radius 4
whalefall  98 -32  length 13  toward 30
whalesong  at 50 for 10

shot 0 Moonlight
  key   -2.5 -13.2 1.0   -3 -4 -4   66
shot 7 Spawning
  key   -1.0 -12.8 0.5   0.5 -13.2 -8   52
  key   -0.6 -12.6 0.0   0.8 -13.0 -8   50
shot 15 Into the dark
  follow rov  behind 5  up 1.2  side 2  fov 58
shot 23 Lanternfish
  key   34 -10 -10   38 -10 -17   58
shot 29 The angler
  key   50.2 -12.3 -16.2   51 -12.5 -18   36
shot 35 Giant squid
  key   67.5 -9.6 -17.5   74 -10 -22   58
shot 43 The vents
  key   108 -9 -16   119 -10 -34   60
  key   109 -9.5 -17   119 -10 -34   58
shot 52 The whale fall
  key   94 -12 -24   98 -14 -32   54
  key   95 -11.6 -25   98 -14 -32   52
